# Skullcrack's rulings: a prevention effect that resolved before it prevents nothing for the rest of the turn ("damage can't
# be prevented this turn", CR 615.12), and nothing gains life ("players can't gain life this turn", CR 119.7), lifelink
# included (CR 702.15b). Bot1 attacks with Bofur, Reliable Guardian (1/1 lifelink) and Llanowar Elves; nothing blocks. In
# the declare blockers step Bot2 casts Fog and it resolves; then Bot1 casts Skullcrack at Bot2. Combat damage is dealt in
# full - Fog prevents none of it - and Bofur's lifelink gains Bot1 nothing: Bot2 ends at 20 - 3 - 2 = 15, Bot1 at 20.

